# AI Shopping Assistant Project Working Agreement

## Who this client is

This is my personal design project for an AI-assisted eCommerce shopping app.
The app aims to save customers time by comparing products and prices and recommending suitable deals.
I am the project owner and final design decision-maker.

## Who their users are

Customers want help finding products that meet their needs and budget.
They use the AI to compare options and recommend a suitable deal.
The customer makes the final purchase decision.

## Already settled

Recommendations must consider the customer's needs, budget, total cost including delivery, seller reliability, and return conditions.
The AI recommends a deal; the customer approves the final product and total cost before an order is placed.

## Never here

Never place an order or authorize payment without the customer's explicit approval.
Never call a product the best deal based only on its listed price.
Never present unavailable price, delivery, seller, or return information as verified.

## Done means

A customer can describe their needs and budget, understand the recommended deal and its total cost, and explicitly approve or decline the purchase before any order is placed.
